        <p>DEBTS PURCHASED. OR COLLECTED ON COMMISSION.</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO AGENTS AND PROPERTY OWNERS : Certified under the Law of Distress Amendment Act. All Communications from Town or Couatry promptly' attended to. -- Agent for the Imperial Live Stock, Accident, Northern Plate Glass Insurance Companies. OFFICE': 24, DIAL STREET, WARRINGTON. HOURS, 9 TO 5.</p>
