        <p>ress, and Shetland Wool Bed, Bolster and Pillows 0 38 6 art Iron Bed.tead, with Spring Mattress attoched 0 21 0 Ont.led Hair Mattress Wool Bed. Bolster and Pillows ALL GUARANTEED FOR FIVE YEA.RS.</p>
